{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>聖誕假期就快到，人未放假，心已經飛咗去旅行啦！想沿途打卡更加開心，又點少得帶埋可愛嘅旅伴一齊出發？玩具「反」斗城獨家推出全新 playpop x Sanrio「Off to Travel」系列，Hello Kitty 同一班人氣好友已經換上期間限定嘅出遊新裝，化身多款超實用嘅旅行好物，陪你正式開啟 Holiday Mode！</p>\n<h2>長途機必備！陪你舒服出走兼隨時掃貨</h2>\n<p>去旅行搭長途機或者坐火車，最緊要坐得舒服，一個可愛嘅頸枕絕對係好幫手。今次系列嘅頸枕有齊 Hello Kitty、Kuromi、Cinnamoroll、Pompompurin 同 Hangyodon 五大角色圖案，配搭粉紅、紫、藍、黃同綠色等柔和色調，等你喺旅途中都可以舒服叉足電。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/sanrio-off-to-travel-group-shot_3820529196afc15ff26811-1024x1365.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sanrio （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/sanrio-off-to-travel-group-shot_3820529196afc15ff26811-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954540954554954575954546954548_neck-pillow-group-shot_12418733566afc14bfe79ce-1024x1368.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sanrio （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954540954554954575954546954548_neck-pillow-group-shot_12418733566afc14bfe79ce-1024x1368.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>除咗休息，去旅行當然要瘋狂 Shopping！毛公仔匙扣連環保袋就最啱帶出街，平時係一個小巧可愛嘅角色毛公仔掛飾，打開就會變成印滿圖案嘅隨身袋，一物兩用，實用又可愛，去買手信或者日常外出都非常方便。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954522954524954524954530954532954538_eco-bag-group-shot2_2899166736afc14e73212b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954522954524954524954530954532954538_eco-bag-group-shot2_2899166736afc14e73212b-1024x1368.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954522_plush-with-eco-bag-hello-kitty_2686817946afc14eada464.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954522_plush-with-eco-bag-hello-kitty_2686817946afc14eada464-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954532_plush-with-eco-bag-cinnamoroll_8757178866afc1505babe3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954532_plush-with-eco-bag-cinnamoroll_8757178866afc1505babe3-1024x1368.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>行李都要扮靚靚！搶眼配件輕鬆打卡</h2>\n<p>旅行嘅儀式感，由機場出發嗰一刻就開始！想行李箱喺行李輸送帶上一眼就認出，一定要換上搶眼嘅裝備。系列推出咗鮮黃色嘅行李帶，印滿 Sanrio 好友嘅出遊造型，為行李箱增添亮眼色彩。再配埋同系列嘅角色行李牌，粉絲可以按自己喜好揀選專屬旅伴，未到目的地已經忍唔住想打卡。另外仲有鮮黃色嘅主題護照套，每次喺機場攞本護照出嚟都零舍開心，完美為假期揭開序幕。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954492_luggage-strap-sanrio-travel_11773235146afc152c8cfc3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954492_luggage-strap-sanrio-travel_11773235146afc152c8cfc3-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954459954465954467954473954486_group-shot1_3689785686afc153041960.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954459954465954467954473954486_group-shot1_3689785686afc153041960.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954459954465954467954473954486_group-shot2_15295115086afc153726329.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1286\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954459954465954467954473954486_group-shot2_15295115086afc153726329-1024x1372.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>執行李變得超治癒！輕鬆收納旅行裝備</h2>\n<p>好多人覺得執行李好頭痛，但有咗靚靚收納袋就變成開心事！旅行收納袋以柔和色調配搭角色圖案，幫你將衣物同旅行小物分類整理得井井有條，打開個篋一目了然。如果係去週末小旅行，或者想帶定個袋去裝戰利品，摺疊旅行袋就係完美首選。袋身採用簡約灰色，配上亮黃色提帶同可愛角色圖案，帶住周圍去都輕鬆百搭。仲有一款亮黃色提帶環保袋，集合多位角色嘅可愛造型，無論係旅行買嘢定週末行街都好啱用。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954503_travel-organizer_15343498156afc155c34f58-1024x1368.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sanrio （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954503_travel-organizer_15343498156afc155c34f58-1024x1368.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954376_shopping-bag-m-sanrio-2026_12451187326afc156689de9-1024x1368.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sanrio （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/skn_954376_shopping-bag-m-sanrio-2026_12451187326afc156689de9-1024x1368.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>有到日本旅遊前要了解的實用資料嗎？<i></i></p>\n<p>日本是香港人最愛的兩大旅遊地點，去旅行前必看<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1383500/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1383500\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">5大旅遊保險保障新冠肺炎的比較</a></b>，另外為你推介<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1393824/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1393824\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本10大好用電話卡</a></b>，亦可參考<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1407050/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1407050\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本8大Wifi蛋推介</a></b>。當然亦要事先了解<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1408657/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1408657\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本地區天氣、電壓、電源插頭、入境簽證要求及大使館電話</a></b>。</p>\n<p>日本已開放自由行，有最新的旅遊景點推介嗎？<i></i></p>\n<p>想要行程推薦的可以參考以下資訊：<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1381681/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1381681\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大阪自由行攻略</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/710254/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=710254\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">富士山28大景點</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1385274/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1385274\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">福岡自由行懶人包</a></b>及<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1023634/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1023634\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京自駕遊路線</a></b>。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.216493+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1153,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:46:07.993783+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:54.700661+00:00","content_hash":"d59e7a3c2aa091580a4190d468dc279069afd80a5bf59cf45071153491cd9318","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}